        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "TD75 is an electric limited-access drill rig designed to install micropiles. The rig’s model number indicates the horsepower of the electric motor. Most of TEI’s drifters/rotary heads can be paired with the TD75. Perfect for operation in small spaces, under buildings or in tunnels. TEI’s drill rigs require only an external power source, which reduces noise and exhaust fumes."
        },
